codex
I found the precise container defect: Lean 4.22 resolves its executable through `/proc/<namespace-pid>/exe`, but this container exposes `/proc` from a different PID namespace, so that path is absent even though `/proc/self/exe` works. I’m applying a narrow, local readlink shim under `/tmp/audit-work` that redirects only `/proc/<digits>/exe` to `/proc/self/exe`; it does not alter any candidate, provenance input, or generated source. This should let the pinned trusted Lean binary perform the required clean build.
apply patch
