+- `preflight-result.json`: fresh returned preflight evidence
+- `stage4-structure.txt`: no-obligation, no-target, no-candidate checks
+- `symbol-occurrences.txt`: frozen semantic and specification linkage
+
+VERDICT: PASS
+LEGITIMACY: LEGIT
